-- Color.cm -- Gargoyle, the 1986 colour illustrator, on the colour display.-- Gargoyle is Griffin's successor and the direct ancestor of the one in the-- Cedar 13 screenshots; its load file is signed by Ken Pier and Eric Bier.Echo Turning the colour display on...ColorDisplay onEcho Fetching Gargoyle. This is a BIG package (253 files plus its importEcho closure) so give it several minutes; the DSK and NET lamps will work.Bringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Gargoyle.dfEcho Loading Gargoyle, its packages, and the ColorTool...Source Gargoyle.loadEcho Gargoyle is up. Use its ColorTool to pick fill and line colours, draw aEcho shape, then drag the viewer onto the colour screen.